{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はMUSICDAYに出演させていただきました。\nすごく緊張しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのような大舞台に立たせていただき、本当に、ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、乃木坂46さんの『きっかけ』という曲が改めてだいだいだいすきになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞くたびに元気になれるし頑張ろうって決意できます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH86XDWAQTAPXV4QW6PKPV9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと写真撮ったので小出ししていきます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『徳山大五郎を誰が殺したか?』ドラマ撮影も頑張っております( ' ༥ ' )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH86YGXVVY5R3GAR0R56ESR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃめ〜( ' ༥ ' )♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完成した第1話を一足先に見させていただいたのですが、\nすごい!!!とても面白くて奇妙で素敵なドラマになっております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひぜひぜひ、お楽しみに〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お兄ちゃんからうぱおの近況が送られてました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH86ZF4SYFS44QYE315KBYQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水槽の中がおしゃれになってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い(笑)なぜ椅子(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も癒しがほしいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログお読みいただきありがとう